============================================================================================================
READING
============================================================================================================
  A 'COX' tag anywhere is a crossover.  Compare the columns at T=60:
  if the MLE column never goes negative while a SGD column does, the
  crossover is a property of the FIT and not of the likelihood, and the
  paper's section 6.2 mechanism has to be restated in those terms.

  The three factors are separated as follows.  val=0.2 against val=0.0
  isolates the cost of withholding a fifth of the training split;
  stop against nostop isolates early stopping at equal data; pen=1e-3
  against pen=0 isolates the P-spline penalty on alpha.
